{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Vector Horizon</i> puts you in control of a high-powered car built for the skies. With thrusters that let you launch and fly, your goal is simple: survive intricate obstacle courses designed to test your skill and creativity \u2014 and maybe look cool doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no race. There\u2019s no one else on the track. Just you, your flying car, and a path full of floating platforms, tight turns, and gravity-defying challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're chasing a clean run or just trying to land upright, <i>Vector Horizon</i> is all about the joy of movement and the thrill of pulling it off.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801540?t=1749472498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/c46d9d1fd4a6156492e44a6afb7c62a02cf0e6ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749472498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/18482a6aaa3324ff526f4bb9083e4772822377a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749472498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801540/18482a6aaa3324ff526f4bb9083e4772822377a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749472498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Vector Horizon</i> puts you in control of a high-powered car built for the skies. With thrusters that let you launch and fly, your goal is simple: survive intricate obstacle courses designed to test your skill and creativity \u2014 and maybe look cool doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no race. There\u2019s no one else on the track. Just you, your flying car, and a path full of floating platforms, tight turns, and gravity-defying challenge